WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.770
The Academy and Pro Trader support one
learning journey.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.710
In the Academy, open a guide, follow a

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.930
lesson, and save your practice notes.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.170
Use Open app to explore Pro Trader, your
chart-analysis workspace,

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.370
and the tools discussed in that lesson.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.210
The Academy and app have separate sign-
ins.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.710
Joining the Academy does not open a broker

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.490
account or connect MetaTrader.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.830
Keep that distinction clear as you
explore.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:26.270
Start with one lesson.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:27.650
Try the relevant tool.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.510
Then return to your notes and explain what
you observed.

